msgid ""
"This list is based on the vLLM main community model list and categorizes the"
" support status of vllm-ascend with labels such as Supported, Experimental, "
"and Unmaintained. Models not listed may be verified independently."
msgstr ""
"本列表基于 vLLM 主社区模型列表，并使用 Supported（已支持）、Experimental（实验性）和 "
"Unmaintained（不再维护）等标签对 vllm-ascend 的支持状态进行分类。未列出的模型可自行验证。"

msgid "|Legend|Description|Usage|Recommendation|"
msgstr "|图例|说明|用途|建议|"

msgid ""
"|✅|Supported|Fully implemented and verified, meeting both functional and "
"performance standards.|Can be used in production environments.|"
msgstr "|✅|已支持|已完整实现并验证，功能与性能均达到标准。|可用于生产环境。|"

msgid ""
"|🔵|Experimental|Implemented and basically functional, but still under "
"improvement. May have instability or performance fluctuations.|Can be used "
"for testing/pre-research, production use requires risk assessment.|"
msgstr "|🔵|实验性|已实现且基本可用，但仍处于改进阶段。可能存在不稳定或性能波动。|可用于测试/预研，生产使用需评估风险。|"

msgid ""
"|🟡|Unverified|Code has been merged but not yet subjected to system testing. "
"Behavior is uncertain and cannot be evaluated.|Users assume the risk of "
"use.|"
msgstr "|🟡|未验证|代码已合入但尚未经过系统测试。行为不确定，无法评估。|使用风险由用户自行承担。|"

msgid ""
"|🔴|Unmaintained|Previously supported, but now discontinued and no longer "
"maintained. Issues will not be fixed.|Do not use in new projects.|"
msgstr "|🔴|不再维护|此前支持，但现已停止且不再维护。问题将不再修复。|请勿在新项目中使用。|"

msgid ""
"|❌|Unsupported|Not implemented in the current version and cannot be "
"used.|Not available.|"
msgstr "|❌|不支持|当前版本未实现，无法使用。|不可用。|"

